// Bandit Level 16 → Level 17

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 16 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit16@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 15.

Step3: The next credentials are available through a service running on localhost in the port range `31000` to `32000`.

Step4: Scan the port range:

        nmap -p 31000-32000 localhost

Step5: Find the open ports and identify which ones support SSL/TLS:

        nmap -sV -p 31000-32000 localhost

Step6: Connect to the SSL/TLS service on port `31790`:

        openssl s_client -connect localhost:31790

Step7: Enter the Bandit Level 16 password and press Enter.

Step8: The correct service returns an RSA private key for the next level.

Step9: Save the private key:

        nano /tmp/bandit17.key

Step10: Set the correct permissions:

        chmod 600 /tmp/bandit17.key

Step11: Use the private key to log in to Bandit Level 17:

        ssh -i /tmp/bandit17.key bandit17@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step12: Read the password for Bandit Level 17:

        cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit17

Step13: The password obtained is:

        xLYVMN9WE5zQ5vHacb0sZEVqbrp7nBTn

Step14: The Bandit Level 16 → Level 17 challenge is solved.

Step15: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
